onic Onassis, the adventures of regulars and casual patrons unfold. Searching for a pinball machine or a payphone, they encounter the omnipresent \"technician,\" so called for his passion for soccer and always ready to chat or moderate other people's discussions. Thus, the ordeals of the handyman Bovinelli as he deals with the disasters at Muzzi's house, the diary of a provincial playboy's conquests, the sex life of the fiery prostitute Elvira, the search for a good restaurant during a dazed motorcycle trip with Cocosecco, or a trip to see Bologna play with the lawyer Della Lana become epic tales of tragicomic exploits."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/karNS3a5I0gX1BIwUbmbxabOzaD.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/karNS3a5I0gX1BIwUbmbxabOzaD.png","language":"it","width":4320,"height":1277}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5LELCswWe5KjEFf7W55Rc6uivHK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5LELCswWe5KjEFf7W55Rc6uivHK.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aQhL2fpUdd4yg7Oe2NUvk9lnlRI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aQhL2fpUdd4yg7Oe2NUvk9lnlRI.jpg","language":"it","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kNIqAU18EjzD6wEVbwRHdfk26Ao.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kNIqAU18EjzD6wEVbwRHdfk26Ao.jpg","language":"xx","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/thvLwqKePmZHyHTqBUsvnH28l7d.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/thvLwqKePmZHyHTqBUsvnH28l7d.jpg","language":"xx","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qCU4xU3nu2TwfESBJxlkUI3pzOZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qCU4xU3nu2TwfESBJxlkUI3pzOZ.jpg","language":"xx","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url"